OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,FAriana Grande has said her decision to
OL,7,Ftake a break from the spotlight was
OL,8,F"not a reactive or impulsive thing"
OL,9,Fand has been planned for a long time.
OL,11,FThe singer, 33, has announced she will
OL,12,Ftake a break from public life after
OL,13,Fshe wraps up her current tour and has
OL,14,Fdropped out of the upcoming London
OL,15,Frevival of the Stephen Sondheim
OL,16,Fmusical Sunday In The Park With
OL,17,FGeorge, in which she was due to appear
OL,18,Fopposite her Wicked co-star Jonathan
OL,19,FBailey.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
