OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785865788
OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,FAppearing on stage in Chicago on
OL,7,FMonday night, Grande told the audience
OL,8,Fthe decision came from "a thoughtful
OL,9,Fand empowered place".
OL,11,FIn a fan video shared on Grande's
OL,12,FInstagram story, she said: "Is it ok
OL,13,Fif we get a little real tonight? I
OL,14,Fwrote down my thoughts cos I don't
OL,15,Fwant to forget.
OL,26,@pD@XOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785865788
OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,F"Sometimes when a story comes out
OL,7,Fthat's not directly from me, things
OL,8,Fcan get a little blown out of
OL,9,Fproportion. So I just wanted to speak
OL,10,Fto my fans directly tonight because I
OL,11,Flove you so much. It means a lot to
OL,12,Fme. To let you know how I'm feeling
OL,13,Fand not let the world decide and
OL,14,Fproject. I'd like to just clear the
OL,15,Fair.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785865788
OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,F"Basically the announcement that was
OL,7,Fmade yesterday was not a reactive or
OL,8,Fimpulsive thing. It's something that I
OL,9,Fhave decided. It's a plan that I have
OL,10,Fquietly made a long time ago. It's a
OL,11,Fdecision I was making from a
OL,12,Fthoughtful and empowered place."
OL,14,FGrande's speech was met by rapturous
OL,15,Fapplause and screaming from her fans
OL,16,Finside the concert.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785865788
OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,FShe continued: "I want you to know
OL,7,Fthat many, many things can be true at
OL,8,Fthe same time.
OL,10,F"I want to share this because I heard
OL,11,Fthat my fans were worried that
OL,12,Fnegativity was ruining things for me.
OL,13,FBut I just have to say that could not
OL,14,Fbe more the f*** opposite. This is not
OL,15,Fwhat that is.
OL,17,F"I just want to make it very, very
OL,18,Fclear. Multiple things can be true at
OL,19,Fthe same time. Boundaries can need to
OL,20,Fbe set. Human beings can need a break
OL,21,Fsometimes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785865788
OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,F"And also this can be and will
OL,7,Fcontinue to be the greatest experience
OL,8,Fof my professional and creative life.
OL,10,F"So I just wanted to make that quite
OL,11,Fplain. No matter what noises exist out
OL,12,Fthere, nothing will ever be able to
OL,13,Fdistort my reality or be more real to
OL,14,Fme or louder to me than this love that
OL,15,Fwe share or how it feels to make art
OL,16,Fwith the people that I love and
OL,17,Frespect. Absolutely nothing will
OL,18,Fchange that.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785865788
OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,F"I love you, and this is what I will
OL,7,Falways take with me, because the rest
OL,8,Fof this s*** is not mine to carry, so
OL,9,FI don't carry it."
OL,11,FShe added that the current tour has
OL,12,Fbeen the most "healing creative and
OL,13,Fspecial experience of my life".
OL,15,FOn Sunday, it was announced Grande
OL,16,Fwill take "a step back from
OL,17,Fvisibility" after her Eternal Sunshine
OL,18,Ftour, which will come to the UK in
OL,19,FAugust, with a 10-night residency at
OL,20,FLondon's The O2.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
