PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785865788
OL,3,CAriana Grande speaks out on decision
OL,4,Cto step back from the spotlight
OL,6,FA representative for the singer said:
OL,7,F"She looks forward to finishing the
OL,8,Ftour and ending it on a high note,
OL,9,Fboth healthily and happily, and then
OL,10,Ftaking a much-deserved break from
OL,11,Fpublic-facing work and appearances,
OL,12,Fwhich has led to endless, ongoing
OL,13,Fpublic scrutiny."
OL,15,FIt came after Grande released the
OL,16,Fmusic video for Petal, the title
OL,17,Fsingle from her newly released eighth
OL,18,Fstudio album, which sparked
OL,19,Fspeculation about her health.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
